;            +Model Formula:  Y = ( B1 +B4*X2+B5*X3+B6*X4+B7*X5+B8*X6+B9*X7 ) * ( X1 - B0 )^B2 * EXP( B3 * ( X1 - B0 ) )
;                -Where: Y=t_mervol,X1=plotage,X2=dm_er1,X3=dm_er2,X4=dm_sc1,X5=dm_sc2,X6=dm_cc1,X7=dm_cc2
;            +Parameter Values: 
;                -B1 = 20.000000|©;-B2 = 0.933355|®;-B3 = 1.762000|©
;                -B4 = -0.029433|©;-B5 = 0.110689|®;-B6 = 0.184766|®
;                -B7 = -0.180714|®;-B8 = -0.460885|®;-B9 = -0.339298|®
;                -B10 = -0.425107|®
;    -Component Mapping:  
;        >White Spruce: 
;            +Method Used: Calculation
;            +Component(s)/Formula Used: 
;                -White Spruce * [1+(|Softwood-(|White Spruce+|Black Spruce+|Balsam Fir+|Tamarack Larch))/
;                 /(|White Spruce+|Black Spruce+|Balsam Fir+|Tamarack Larch)] * [1+(|Total-(|Softwood+
;                 +|Hardwood))/(|Softwood+|Hardwood)]rag@80
;        >Black Spruce: 
;            +Method Used: Calculation
;            +Component(s)/Formula Used: 
;                -Black Spruce * [1+(|Softwood-(|White Spruce+|Black Spruce+|Balsam Fir+|Tamarack Larch))/
;                 /(|White Spruce+|Black Spruce+|Balsam Fir+|Tamarack Larch)] * [1+(|Total-(|Softwood+
;                 +|Hardwood))/(|Softwood+|Hardwood)]rag@80
;        >Balsam Fir: 
;            +Method Used: Calculation
;            +Component(s)/Formula Used: 
;                -Balsam Fir * [1+(|Softwood-(|White Spruce+|Black Spruce+|Balsam Fir+|Tamarack Larch))/
;                 /(|White Spruce+|Black Spruce+|Balsam Fir+|Tamarack Larch)] * [1+(|Total-(|Softwood+
;                 +|Hardwood))/(|Softwood+|Hardwood)]rag@80
;        >Tamarack Larch: 
;            +Method Used: Calculation
;            +Component(s)/Formula Used: 
;                -Tamarack Larch * [1+(|Softwood-(|White Spruce+|Black Spruce+|Balsam Fir+|Tamarack Larch))/
;                 /(|White Spruce+|Black Spruce+|Balsam Fir+|Tamarack Larch)] * [1+(|Total-(|Softwood+
;                 +|Hardwood))/(|Softwood+|Hardwood)]rag@80
;        >Red Maple: 
;            +Method Used: Calculation
;            +Component(s)/Formula Used: 
;                -Red Maple * [1+(|Hardwood-(|Red Maple+|White Birch+|Trembling Aspen+|Yellow Birch))/
;                 /(|Red Maple+|White Birch+|Trembling Aspen+|Yellow Birch)] * [1+(|Total-(|Softwood+
;                 +|Hardwood))/(|Softwood+|Hardwood)]rag@80
;        >White Birch: 
;            +Method Used: Calculation
;            +Component(s)/Formula Used: 
;                -White Birch * [1+(|Hardwood-(|Red Maple+|White Birch+|Trembling Aspen+|Yellow Birch))/
;                 /(|Red Maple+|White Birch+|Trembling Aspen+|Yellow Birch)] * [1+(|Total-(|Softwood+
;                 +|Hardwood))/(|Softwood+|Hardwood)]rag@80
;        >Trembling Aspen: 
;            +Method Used: Calculation
;            +Component(s)/Formula Used: 
;                -Trembling Aspen * [1+(|Hardwood-(|Red Maple+|White Birch+|Trembling Aspen+|Yellow Birch))/
;                 /(|Red Maple+|White Birch+|Trembling Aspen+|Yellow Birch)] * [1+(|Total-(|Softwood+
;                 +|Hardwood))/(|Softwood+|Hardwood)]rag@80
;        >Yellow Birch: 
;            +Method Used: Calculation
;            +Component(s)/Formula Used: 
;                -Yellow Birch * [1+(|Hardwood-(|Red Maple+|White Birch+|Trembling Aspen+|Yellow Birch))/
;                 /(|Red Maple+|White Birch+|Trembling Aspen+|Yellow Birch)] * [1+(|Total-(|Softwood+
;                 +|Hardwood))/(|Softwood+|Hardwood)]rag@80
