;                -B4 = -0.029433|©;-B5 = -0.002883|®;-B6 = 0.062574|®
;                -B7 = -0.172604|®;-B8 = -0.360881|®;-B9 = -0.104027|®
;                -B10 = -0.238655|®
;    -Component Mapping:  
;        >White Spruce: 
;            +Method Used: Calculation
;            +Component(s)/Formula Used: 
