;                 +|Hardwood))/(|Softwood+|Hardwood)]rag@80
;        >Black Spruce: 
;            +Method Used: Calculation
;            +Component(s)/Formula Used: 
;                -Black Spruce * [1+(|Softwood-(|White Spruce+|Black Spruce+|Balsam Fir+|Tamarack Larch))/
;                 /(|White Spruce+|Black Spruce+|Balsam Fir+|Tamarack Larch)] * [1+(|Total-(|Softwood+
;                 +|Hardwood))/(|Softwood+|Hardwood)]rag@80
;        >Balsam Fir: 
;            +Method Used: Calculation
;            +Component(s)/Formula Used: 
;                -Balsam Fir * [1+(|Softwood-(|White Spruce+|Black Spruce+|Balsam Fir+|Tamarack Larch))/
;                 /(|White Spruce+|Black Spruce+|Balsam Fir+|Tamarack Larch)] * [1+(|Total-(|Softwood+
;                 +|Hardwood))/(|Softwood+|Hardwood)]rag@80
;        >Tamarack Larch: 
;            +Method Used: Calculation
;            +Component(s)/Formula Used: 
;                -Tamarack Larch * [1+(|Softwood-(|White Spruce+|Black Spruce+|Balsam Fir+|Tamarack Larch))/
;                 /(|White Spruce+|Black Spruce+|Balsam Fir+|Tamarack Larch)] * [1+(|Total-(|Softwood+
;                 +|Hardwood))/(|Softwood+|Hardwood)]rag@80
;        >Red Maple: 
;            +Method Used: Calculation
;            +Component(s)/Formula Used: 
;                -Red Maple * [1+(|Hardwood-(|Red Maple+|White Birch+|Trembling Aspen))/(|Red Maple+
;                 +|White Birch+|Trembling Aspen)] * [1+(|Total-(|Softwood+|Hardwood))/(|Softwood+
;                 +|Hardwood)]rag@80
;        >White Birch: 
;            +Method Used: Calculation
;            +Component(s)/Formula Used: 
;                -White Birch * [1+(|Hardwood-(|Red Maple+|White Birch+|Trembling Aspen))/(|Red Maple+
;                 +|White Birch+|Trembling Aspen)] * [1+(|Total-(|Softwood+|Hardwood))/(|Softwood+
;                 +|Hardwood)]rag@80
;        >Trembling Aspen: 
;            +Method Used: Calculation
;            +Component(s)/Formula Used: 
;                -Trembling Aspen * [1+(|Hardwood-(|Red Maple+|White Birch+|Trembling Aspen))/(|Red Maple+
;                 +|White Birch+|Trembling Aspen)] * [1+(|Total-(|Softwood+|Hardwood))/(|Softwood+
;                 +|Hardwood)]rag@80
